{"id":"8ad5058535b9125d","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-omega-consistency.md","title":"标准数字实例意义下的 ω 一致性","display":"df-omega-consistency — 标准数字实例意义下的 ω 一致性","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-omega-consistency","aliases":["91-df-omega-consistency","91-df-omega-con"],"display":"df-omega-consistency — 标准数字实例意义下的 ω 一致性","depends_on":["[[91-df-numeral]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-omega-consistency"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-omega-consistency</span><span>91-df-omega-con</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-omega-consistency — 标准数字实例意义下的 ω 一致性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"822ef14bbd4e020d\" href=\"?note=822ef14bbd4e020d\" title=\"91-df-numeral\">91-df-numeral</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 为经典算术扩张理论，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_S}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_S}\\)</span> 为至多以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 自由的公式类；实例取标准 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\\operatorname{-Con}(S)\">\\(\\omega\\operatorname{-Con}(S)\\)</span> 是下述元层性质。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}omega\\text{-}consistency}\\vdash\\quad\n\\omega\\operatorname{-Con}(S)\\coloneqq\\neg\\exists\\varphi(x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_S}\\,\n[S\\vdash\\exists x\\varphi(x)\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(S\\vdash\\neg\\varphi(\\overline n))].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}omega\\text{-}consistency}\\vdash\\quad\n\\omega\\operatorname{-Con}(S)\\coloneqq\\neg\\exists\\varphi(x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_S}\\,\n[S\\vdash\\exists x\\varphi(x)\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(S\\vdash\\neg\\varphi(\\overline n))].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>有标准自然数模型是 ω 一致性的充分条件；标准 KF 的固定点经典闭包因此同时给出一致性和 ω 一致性。FS 则一致但 ω 不一致。\nω 一致性不排除非标准模型，也不保证每个已证存在句都有一个理论可证的标准见证。它只禁止把全部标准实例逐一否定；旧“排除非标准解释”和“保证断言有真实实例”表述过强。\n不一致的经典理论会违反此性质（取恒假的矩阵），所以 ω 一致性蕴含句法一致性。该元层定义不等于一个未加解释的对象自然数公式。</p>\n<p>来源：Chapter 13、Corollary 14.17；Theorem 15.15 的标准 KF 模型。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"822ef14bbd4e020d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-numeral]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_S}","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega\\operatorname{-Con}(S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}omega\\text{-}consistency}\\vdash\\quad\n\\omega\\operatorname{-Con}(S)\\coloneqq\\neg\\exists\\varphi(x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_S}\\,\n[S\\vdash\\exists x\\varphi(x)\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(S\\vdash\\neg\\varphi(\\overline n))].","display":true}],"bytes":1547,"backlinks":[{"id":"cda20fabbaa06580","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"8556c1ac7447fbfa","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-78","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-omega-consistency]]"},{"id":"e9